OL,3,GNEWSAExtra Halloween security hired as
OL,4,Ashoplifting cases soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fancy dress shop owner says he is
OL,7,Fhaving to hire additional security
OL,8,Fguards in the run-up to Halloween
OL,9,Fbecause of soaring levels of
OL,10,Fshoplifting and antisocial behaviour.
OL,12,FGary Wakefield, who runs Lili Bizarre
OL,13,Ffancy dress and balloon shop in
OL,14,FLiverpool city centre, complained to
OL,15,Fthe BBC that police were not doing
OL,16,Fenough to investigate and prosecute
OL,17,Fshoplifters, despite businesses
OL,18,Fproviding them with evidence.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
