OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1789561561
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAExtra Halloween security hired as
OL,4,Ashoplifting cases soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Chris Ruane of Merseyside
OL,7,FPolice said: "It's not good enough. The
OL,8,Fpolice are a public body and are
OL,9,Faccountable.
OL,11,F"If you are not happy with the service
OL,12,Fyou are getting, whether that be a
OL,13,Freport, an incident or a crime report,
OL,14,Fflag it up and report it back in and we
OL,15,Fcan review it."
